        <h3 class="text-center mb-5">How to use chatbot</h3>
        <p>Here are some guidelines for you to follow:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Write down clear and concise questions (for example, you might ask: <i> Briefly describe the automaton</i>, <i>How many states are
                there?</i>, <i>Is there an arc from q0 to q1?</i>, <i>How is the automaton represented?</i>)</li>
            <li>Questions should purely concern finite-state automata (no small talk, for example)</li>
            <li>Questions may refer to the description of the automaton, the states and transitions present, the accepted language, and its representation</li>
            <li>You can always refer to past questions and aswers looking at the table at the bottom of the chatbot page which keeps track of the conversation history</li>
        </ul>
